364
00:15:28,770 --> 00:15:29,230
Hey, everyone.

365
00:15:29,530 --> 00:15:36,680
Welcome back to another English learning session where we help you sound more natural, confident, and professional in English conversations.

366
00:15:37,180 --> 00:15:38,060
I'm Ethan.

367
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:38,780
And I'm Mia.

368
00:15:39,100 --> 00:15:40,880
