582
00:25:11,540 --> 00:25:12,160
Exactly.

583
00:25:12,500 --> 00:25:16,710
Today's topic is real business English phrases for daily work.

584
00:25:16,690 --> 00:25:28,830
We'll teach you natural business phrases, explain their meanings, and show you practical example conversations so you can understand how native speakers really communicate in offices and professional environments.

585
00:25:29,250 --> 00:25:32,550
