00:34:19,960 --> 00:34:24,610
Real fluency comes from learning natural phrases and practicing them regularly.

802
00:34:24,590 --> 00:34:31,700
Try repeating these expressions out loud and imagine yourself using them in meetings, emails, and office conversations.

803
00:34:32,100 --> 00:34:36,080
The more you practice, the more confident and professional your English will sound.

